# Summary

Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter. [[cite:obs-84945d05b07a748565e2d58c54cfd3774a2552a1 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The yearly amount is one hundred twenty (120) EUR. [[cite:obs-e3850140b7a5592f7795ad1a5cc72e4b9ac0419b "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]

The contribution is payable within January. [[cite:obs-e3850140b7a5592f7795ad1a5cc72e4b9ac0419b "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
